OL,3,GNEWSABattery warning after bin lorry
OL,4,Afire in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bin lorry crew had to dump eight
OL,7,Ftonnes of waste on to a residential
OL,8,Fstreet after a fire broke out in the
OL,9,Fvehicle's load, prompting a warning
OL,10,Fabout battery disposal.
OL,12,FThe Erewash Borough Council refuse crew
OL,13,Fwas working in Neale Street, Long
OL,14,FEaton, when the fire broke out after
OL,15,F14:00 BST on Thursday 1 October.
OL,17,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,18,Ffirefighters from Long Eaton and
OL,19,FNottinghamshire's Stapleford station
OL,20,Fput out the fire once the waste was
OL,21,Ftipped out.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
