OL,3,GNEWSABattery warning after bin lorry
OL,4,Afire in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council urged residents not to put
OL,7,Fitems containing batteries into bins
OL,8,Fafter investigations found multiple
OL,9,Fvapes and a cordless vacuum in the
OL,10,Frubbish.
